Error [E0003]: An `if` used as a value needs an `else` branch
  --> tests/ui/if_expr_missing_else.jet:2:23
    |
  2 |     m :: if 1 > 0 -> 5
    |                       ^
 Why: When `if` produces a value, both branches must produce one (S68)
 Fix: Add `else -> value` so every path has a value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
